SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_CaptainGreeting::
    .string "CAPTAIN: Welcome aboard the S.S. MINNOW,\n"
    .string "Samuel!\p"
    .string "We had smooth sailing navigating\n"
    .string "the coastal waters to reach Kanto.\p"
    .string "Take all the time you need to prepare\n"
    .string "before heading out into VERMILION CITY!\p"
    .string "I wish you the best of luck on your\n"
    .string "scientific expedition!$"

